WEBVTT

00:09:58.344 --> 00:10:00.137
"What kind of father am I?"

00:10:01.764 --> 00:10:03.724
He looked at me and said,

00:10:03.766 --> 00:10:06.185
"Um, you have a mustache,"

00:10:06.226 --> 00:10:08.646
(Laughter)

00:10:08.646 --> 00:10:11.398
"Long hair," this was before
the haircut, may I add.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:12.983
(Laughter)

00:10:13.025 --> 00:10:14.526
"And even a new computer."

00:10:16.195 --> 00:10:18.030
I was like, "OK, this is true, son."

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:22.785
He goes on to say,

00:10:22.785 --> 00:10:25.788
"I love it when you buy me games,"
before hugging me --

00:10:25.788 --> 00:10:28.457
(Laughter)

00:10:28.499 --> 00:10:30.125
And running back to his room.